# Automotive Data Pipeline Project

This project builds a robust data pipeline for acquiring, processing, transforming, and loading automotive datasets from public U.S. government sources using Databricks and the Medallion architecture. It focuses on objectives, data sources, processing layers, automation strategy, challenges, and dashboard insights derived from the data.

## Table of Contents
