- [Medallion Architecture Implementation](#medallion-architecture-implementation)
- [NHTSA Data Pipeline](#nhtsa-data-pipeline)
- [AFDC Data Pipeline](#afdc-data-pipeline)
- [EPA Data Pipeline](#epa-data-pipeline)
